  "description": "Bring playful charm and adorable style to your projects with this Kawaii Seamless Patterns Bundle. This collection features cute kawaii-inspired designs including sweet characters, simple icons, pastel elements, and cheerful motifs arranged into seamless repeating patterns.\nEach pattern tile is designed with soft colors, rounded shapes, and a fun, friendly aesthetic—perfect for fabric printing, scrapbooking, planners, stationery, packaging, kids projects, and digital paper collections. The seamless format ensures smooth repetition for professional surface pattern design.\nThese high-resolution kawaii patterns are ideal for designers, crafters, and print-on-demand creators who love cute, colorful, and joyful artwork.\n👉 You will receive [27] seamless pattern tiles, suitable for print and digital use.\nWhat’s Included\n– [27] Seamless pattern tiles (JPEG)\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px\n– Kawaii themed repeating pattern designs\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer\nKey Features\n– Seamless repeating kawaii patterns\n– Cute cartoon & pastel aesthetic\n– Clean, playful and friendly designs\n– High-resolution printable quality\n– Designed for surface pattern use\nPerfect For\n– Seamless fabric & textile printing\n– Scrapbooking & digital paper packs\n– Planners, journals & stationery\n– Kids products & cute branding\n– Packaging & wrapping paper\n– Surface pattern design collections\nNote\nThis is a digital product only. No physical item will be shipped.\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring playful charm and adorable style to your projects with this Kawaii Seamless Patterns Bundle. This collection features cute kawaii-inspired designs including sweet characters, simple icons, pastel elements, and cheerful motifs arranged into seamless repeating patterns.</p>\n<p>Each pattern tile is designed with soft colors, rounded shapes, and a fun, friendly aesthetic—perfect for fabric printing, scrapbooking, planners, stationery, packaging, kids projects, and digital paper collections. The seamless format ensures smooth repetition for professional surface pattern design.</p>\n<p>These high-resolution kawaii patterns are ideal for designers, crafters, and print-on-demand creators who love cute, colorful, and joyful artwork.</p>\n<p>👉 You will receive [27] seamless pattern tiles, suitable for print and digital use.</p>\n<p>What’s Included</p>\n<p>– [27] Seamless pattern tiles (JPEG)<br>\n– Size: 3072 × 3072 px<br>\n– Kawaii themed repeating pattern designs<br>\n– Fully editable: resize, recolor, rotate, or layer</p>\n<p>Key Features</p>\n<p>– Seamless repeating kawaii patterns<br>\n– Cute cartoon &amp; pastel aesthetic<br>\n– Clean, playful and friendly designs<br>\n– High-resolution printable quality<br>\n– Designed for surface pattern use</p>\n<p>Perfect For</p>\n<p>– Seamless fabric &amp; textile printing<br>\n– Scrapbooking &amp; digital paper packs<br>\n– Planners, journals &amp; stationery<br>\n– Kids products &amp; cute branding<br>\n– Packaging &amp; wrapping paper<br>\n– Surface pattern design collections</p>\n<p>Note</p>\n<p>This is a digital product only. No physical item will be shipped.<br>\nColors may vary slightly depending on screen and printer settings.</p>",
